================================================================================
THIRD-PARTY CODE
================================================================================

This product contains geometry logic for rendering indent guides that is
derived from JetBrains IntelliJ Community Edition:

    Project : intellij-community
    Source  : platform/lang-impl/src/com/intellij/codeInsight/daemon/impl/
              IndentGuideRenderer.java
    Repo    : https://github.com/JetBrains/intellij-community
    License : Apache License, Version 2.0
              https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

The derived code lives in:
    src/main/kotlin/com/hua/rainbow_parentheses/indents/RainbowIndentGuideRenderer.kt

That file replicates the original's vertical-extent computation (skipping
blank lines upward from the highlighter start, +lineHeight start offset,
end-line top, and a folding-collapsed early return) and replaces only the
coloring logic. No source code from any other plugin or project was copied;
the rest of this project is independent work.

================================================================================
PLATFORM RUNTIME
================================================================================

This plugin runs on top of the IntelliJ Platform SDK (also Apache License,
Version 2.0) provided by JetBrains s.r.o. The SDK is not bundled with this
plugin; it is part of the host IDE at runtime.
